name: ['Abundant Maw', 'Accursed Witch // Infectious Curse', 'Advanced Stitchwing', 'Aim High', "Alchemist's Greeting", 'Alms of the Vein', 'Altered Ego', 'Always Watching', 'Angelic Purge', 'Anguished Unmaking', 'Apothecary Geist', 'Archangel Avacyn // Avacyn, the Purifier', 'Arlinn Kord // Arlinn, Embraced by the Moon', 'Assembled Alphas', "Avacyn's Judgment", 'Bedlam Reveler', 'Biting Rain', 'Blessed Alliance', 'Blood Mist', 'Bloodbriar', 'Bloodhall Priest', 'Bloodmad Vampire', 'Borrowed Grace', 'Borrowed Hostility', 'Borrowed Malevolence', 'Bound by Moonsilver', 'Brain in a Jar', 'Briarbridge Patrol', 'Bruna, the Fading Light // Brisela, Voice of Nightmares', 'Burn from Within', 'Bygone Bishop', 'Byway Courier', 'Call the Bloodline', 'Certain Death', 'Chittering Host', 'Choked Estuary', 'Clear Shot', 'Collective Brutality', 'Collective Defiance', 'Collective Effort', 'Compelling Deterrence', 'Conduit of Storms // Conduit of Emrakul', 'Confirm Suspicions', 'Confront the Unknown', 'Convolute', 'Courageous Outrider', 'Crawling Sensation', 'Crow of Dark Tidings', 'Cryptolith Fragment // Aurora of Emrakul', 'Cryptolith Rite', 'Curious Homunculus // Voracious Reader', 'Daring Sleuth // Bearer of Overwhelming Truths', 'Dark Salvation', 'Dauntless Cathar', 'Dawn Gryff', 'Dead Weight', 'Deathcap Cultivator', 'Decimator of the Provinces', 'Declaration in Stone', 'Deny Existence', 'Deranged Whelp', 'Descend upon the Sinful', "Devils' Playground", 'Devilthorn Fox', 'Diregraf Colossus', 'Distended Mindbender', 'Docent of Perfection // Final Iteration', 'Drag Under', 'Drogskol Shieldmate', 'Drownyard Behemoth', 'Drownyard Explorers', 'Drunau Corpse Trawler', 'Dusk Feaster', 'Duskwatch Recruiter // Krallenhorde Howler', 'Elder Deep-Fiend', 'Eldritch Evolution', 'Ember-Eye Wolf', 'Emrakul, the Promised End', 'Epiphany at the Drownyard', 'Epitaph Golem', 'Erdwal Illuminator', 'Essence Flux', 'Eternal Scourge', 'Ever After', 'Explosive Apparatus', 'Exultant Cultist', 'Faith Unbro