n', 'Mournwillow', "Murderer's Axe", "Nahiri's Wrath", 'Nahiri, the Harbinger', 'Nearheath Chaplain', 'Nebelgast Herald', 'Neglected Heirloom // Ashmouth Blade', 'Noose Constrictor', 'Noosegraf Mob', 'Obsessive Skinner', 'Odric, Lunarch Marshal', "Olivia's Bloodsworn", "Olivia's Dragoon", 'Olivia, Mobilized for War', 'Ongoing Investigation', 'Pack Guardian', 'Permeating Mass', 'Pick the Brain', 'Pieces of the Puzzle', 'Plains', 'Pore Over the Pages', 'Port Town', 'Prized Amalgam', 'Puncturing Light', 'Pyre Hound', 'Rabid Bite', 'Rattlechains', 'Ravenous Bloodseeker', 'Reaper of Flight Moonsilver', 'Relentless Dead', 'Ride Down', 'Rise from the Grave', 'Rise from the Tides', 'Rush of Adrenaline', 'Ruthless Disposal', 'Sage of Ancient Lore // Werewolf of Ancient Hunger', 'Sanitarium Skeleton', 'Scourge Wolf', 'Seasons Past', 'Second Harvest', 'Selfless Spirit', 'Shreds of Sanity', 'Shrill Howler // Howling Chorus', "Sigarda's Aid", "Sigarda, Heron's Grace", 'Sigardian Priest', 'Sin Prodder', "Slayer's Plate", 'Sorin, Grim Nemesis', 'Soul Separator', 'Spectral Shepherd', 'Spell Queller', 'Spirit of the Hunt', 'Splendid Reclamation', 'Spontaneous Mutation', 'Startled Awake // Persistent Nightmare', 'Steadfast Cathar', 'Stensia Masquerade', "Stitcher's Graft", 'Stone Quarry', 'Stormrider Spirit', 'Strength of Arms', 'Stromkirk Condemned', 'Stromkirk Occultist', 'Subjugator Angel', 'Summary Dismissal', 'Swamp', 'Swift Spinner', 'Take Inventory', "Tamiyo's Journal", 'Tamiyo, Field Researcher', 'Tattered Haunter', 'Terrarion', "Thalia's Lancers", 'Thalia, Heretic Cathar', 'Thermo-Alchemist', 'Thing in the Ice // Awoken Horror', 'Thornhide Wolves', 'Thraben Foulbloods', 'Thraben Inspector', 'Tireless Tracker', 'Topplegeist', 'Tormenting Voice', 'Town Gossipmonger // Incited Rabble', 'Traverse the Ulvenwald', 'Tree of Perdition', 'Triskaidekaphobia', 'True-Faith Censer', 'Ulrich of the Krallenhorde // Ulrich, Uncontested Alpha', "Ulrich's Kindred", 'Ulvenwald Captive // Ulven